<small>Product Similarity Declaration: ADSL CPE ZXDSL 831 Series contains four models: :• ZXDSL 831 • ZXDSL 831II • ZXDSL 831B • ZXDSL 831BII For Model Numbers: ZXDSL 831, ZXDSL 831B and ZXDSL 831BII are electrically identical :with the Model Number: ZXDSL 831II that was certified by BACL. These four models are Single Ethernet port, the difference between them for details: *For model number: ZXDSL 831 is ADSL Routing equipment *For model number: ZXDSL 831II is ADSL2+ Routing equipment and Bridge equipment *For model number: ZXDSL 831B is ADSL Bridges equipment *For model number: ZXDSL 831BII is ADSL2+ Bridges equipment :They are name differently and have different software, no other change are made. Considering for our marketing purposes. We would like to list four models on reports.</small>
===Specifications=== *[[Conexant]] Viking II+ GS8120-174-004DB0EZ - Integrated Network Processor *[[Conexant]] Viking II+ BAZ-3882-NCA - Analog Front End *[[Realtek]] RTL8201CP - Eth. Chip
